  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice pumpkin and red onion into thin wedges.\n• Place pumpkin and onion on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil.\n• Sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e675a587f17f4581097/step-50f9d400.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber and roasted almonds.\n• Halve snacking tomatoes.\n• Thinly slice apple into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e675a587f17f4581097/step-ca6c5c10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a large bowl, combine tomato, cucumber, apple, spinach & rocket mix, basil pesto and a drizzle of vinegar. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e675a587f17f4581097/step-ad33e620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide basil pesto salad between bowls.\n• Top with herby pumpkin and onion.\n• Sprinkle with almonds and crumble over marinated goat cheese to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/686f3e675a587f17f4581097/step-6a8b4330.jpg"
    }
  ]
